      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEKTRA JIMMY (4) goes very well this course and distance starting 18 times for six wins and seven minors. Placed last time (23.39) at this track in a Mix 3/4, finishing second and beaten one length. Looks suited and should go close. STARSHIP ATLAS (1) three runs back posted a fast 23.28 win over 410m at this track then has found the minor money in two runs since. Should be in this for a long way. PRINCESS DOMI (7) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 23.23 beating Aston Grandeur. Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. PAW HARKONNEN (2) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can make amends.",
